  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MISA - 2010-13 Third Strategic Partnership - MISA Pressfreedom SPPIII</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MISA- 2010-13 Pressfrihet</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall objective:to influence positive media policy development and to ensure a conducive environment for the practice of journalism and the operation of a viable, independent and sustainable media in Southern Africa 2010-2013.
This support was a continuation of previous support to MISA (2004 -2009) and was followed by a subsequent short-term support (Oct 2015 to Dec 2016).</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Media Institute of Southern Africa (MISA) third Strategic  Partnership Program.The overall objective of the support is to        influence positive media policy development and to ensure a conducive environment for the practice of journalism and the operation of a     viable, independent and sustainable media in Southern Africa.This     support is a continuation of previous support to MISA (2004 -2009).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Support to Media Institute of Southern Africa (MISA) third Strategic  Partnership Program.The overall objective of the support is to        influence positive media policy development and to ensure a conducive environment for the practice of journalism and the operation of a     viable, independent and sustainable media in Southern Africa.This     support is a continuation of previous support to MISA (2004 -2009).</narrative>
  </description>
